('MCD-00639', 'conf_datacao', 2, 'AVALIADO', 'O ano coincide com a fonte institucional externa para o evento descrito, mas permanece pendente de homologação: O primeiro trem de passageiros Bombay–Thane operou em 16 de abril de 1853.', '[\"Livro-base p. 312: ive British con- trol over India, and railroads spread rapidly over the subcontinent. The first railroad began operations in India in 1853. By 1870 engineers had laid over 4,500 miles of track; by 1936 mileage had risen to 43,000 miles, creating the fourth largest railroad system in the world. Hardly a decade after Morse’s first telegraph\",\"Government of India — Press Information Bureau: O primeiro trem de passageiros Bombay–Thane operou em 16 de abril de 1853.\"]', '[\"LIVRO2006\", \"INST1\", \"MATL5\"]', NULL),
