('MCD-00664', 'conf_rastreabilidade', 1, 'AVALIADO', 'Há localização verificável no livro-base de 2006, página 81, porém segunda fonte independente ainda não foi registrada.', '[\"Livro-base p. 81: te the curiosity of many natural philosophers over subsequent centuries. One of those was Aristarchus of Samos (310–230 bce), an expert astronomer and mathematician and, it seems, an associate of the Museum. According to Archimedes, Aristarchus espoused a helio- centric, or sun-centered, cosmology, not unlike the system proposed by Copern\"]', '[\"LIVRO2006\"]', NULL),
