('MCD-00692', 'conf_datacao', 2, 'AVALIADO', 'O ano coincide com a fonte institucional externa para o evento descrito, mas permanece pendente de homologação: Acervo identifica tubo transmissor experimental produzido por Farnsworth em 1927.', '[\"Livro-base p. 354:  under development, including one by the pioneer Vladi- mir Zworykin (1889–1982) in 1927, Philo T. Farnsworth (1906–71), a farm boy and then a college student, first patented the technology for the electronic transmission and reception of moving images. In 1930, the first commercial television was already broadcasting. Promoters famously \",\"Smithsonian National Museum of American History: Acervo identifica tubo transmissor experimental produzido por Farnsworth em 1927.\"]', '[\"LIVRO2006\", \"INST1\", \"MATL6\"]', NULL),
